,title,link,text,language,family
0,Language isolate - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Language_isolate,"A language isolate, sometimes called an isolated language, is a language that has no demonstrable genealogical relationship with any other language. [1][2] That is, an isolate is a language family that only contains one member.",Sulka,Language isolate
1,Sulka language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sulka_language,"Sulka is a language isolate of New Britain, Papua New Guinea. In 1991, there were 2,500 speakers in eastern Pomio District, East New Britain Province. Villages include Guma.",Sulka,Language isolate
2,Sulka language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/sulka_language,"The Sulka language is a Papuan language isolate spoken by approximately 3,500 people (as of 2005) primarily along Wide Bay in the East New Britain Province of Papua New Guinea.",Sulka,Language isolate
3,E MARIA.. ( sulka language) - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=agfCxe-jtjI,"Enjoy the videos and music you love, upload original content, and share it all with friends, family, and the world on YouTube.",Sulka,Language isolate
4,"Sulka language. Evangelism tools, church planting resources ...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/sua,"Audio recordings available in Sulka These recordings are designed for evangelism and basic Bible teaching to bring the gospel message to people who are not literate or are from oral cultures, particularly unreached people groups.",Sulka,Language isolate
5,Sulka language - a.osmarks.net,https://a.osmarks.net/content/wikipedia_en_all_maxi_2020-08/A/Sulka_language,"The Sulka form is identical to the one found in Mengen and Kove of the North New Guinea linkage, rather than to mal as it appears in languages of the St. George linkage.",Sulka,Language isolate
6,SULKA - YouTube Music,https://music.youtube.com/channel/UCvskp7dQskZqmc7QzCE11vA,"Listen to music from SULKA on YouTube Music - a dedicated music app with official songs, music videos, remixes, covers, and more.",Sulka,Language isolate
7,Sulka language - Wikiwand,https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/Sulka_language,"Sulka is spoken along the coastal region of Wide Bay, [4] on the Southern coast of the Gazelle Peninsula, [6] on the eastern side of New Britain Island, Papua New Guinea.",Sulka,Language isolate
8,"Sulka Language (SUA) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/sua/,"Sulka is an endangered indigenous language of Papua New Guinea. It is an isolate that is not known to be related to any other language. The language is used as a first language by all adults in the ethnic community, but not all young people.",Sulka,Language isolate
